					<source><pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:par" swi18n:slot="children">In this skill you learn to <pc id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:term" swi18n:slot="children">simplify a multiplication of numbers</pc> inside an expression. For instance when seeing <ph id="c3" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/> you should immediately realize, "Oh, that's just <ph id="c4" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/>." This also includes dealing with negative numbers: <ph id="c5" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/> should be adequately turned into <ph id="c6" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/>.</pc></source>
